        "headline": "Flood Watch issued May 31 at 11:49AM AKDT until June 3 at 10:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is possible.\n\n* WHERE...The following areas, Kodiak Island. This includes the\ncities of Kodiak City, Port Lions, Ouzinkie, Old Harbor.\n\n* WHEN...From Monday morning through Wednesday morning.\n\n* IMPACTS...Excessive runoff from heavy rain may result in flooding\nof rivers, creeks, streams, and other low-lying and flood-prone\nlocations, including Bells Flats. Expected heavy rain may saturate\nsoils resulting in isolated landslides in areas of steep terr",
        "severity": "Severe",
        "certainty": "Possible",
        "urgency": "Future",
        "sender": "NWS Anchorage AK",
        "effective": "2026-05-31T11:49:00-08:00",
