        "areas": "Kodiak Island Northeast; Kodiak Island Southwest",
        "category": "Met",
        "response": "Prepare",
        "instruction": "You should monitor later forecasts and be alert for possible Flood\nWarnings. Those living in areas prone to flooding should be prepared\nto take action should flooding develop.\n\nStay tuned to further developments by listening to your local radio,\ntelevision, or NOAA Weather Radio for further informat",
